# Pinned versions and sha256 sums for the tools that ./install downloads
# itself (when the package manager has no package). Change a version and its
# sums together: GitHub shows a sha256 "digest" for each release file, and
# https://go.dev/dl lists the Go sums.
# shellcheck disable=SC2034 # read by the installers in lib/dependencies

